{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type CreateBaseQueryResult<TData, TError, TState> = BaseQueryNarrowing<TData, TError> & MapToSignals<OmitKeyof<TState, keyof BaseQueryNarrowing, \"safely\">>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts#L153","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts:153"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The result of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectQuery"},{"type":"text","value":" when "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialData"},{"type":"text","value":" isn't set — "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":" may be "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" while the query is\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pending"},{"type":"text","value":". Same shape as "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryObserverResult.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"QueryObserverResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/query-core"},{"type":"text","value":", but value fields (like\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"error"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"status"},{"type":"text","value":") are exposed as a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Signal"},{"type":"text","value":" — read them with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"query.data()"},{"type":"text","value":", not "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"query.data"},{"type":"text","value":" —\nwhile function fields (like "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"refetch"},{"type":"text","value":") are called directly, unchanged. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isSuccess"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isError"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isPending"},{"type":"text","value":"\nare "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/BaseQueryNarrowing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"BaseQueryNarrowing"}]},{"type":"text","value":" type-guard methods rather than plain booleans.\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectInfiniteQuery"},{"type":"text","value":" returns "},{"type":"link","href":"CreateInfiniteQueryResult.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CreateInfiniteQueryResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":" instead."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":" ends up as after "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" runs."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" may throw."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tstate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TState"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TState"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryObserverResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryObserverResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tstate","text":"TState","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype CreateBaseQueryResult<TData, TError, TState> = BaseQueryNarrowing<TData, TError> & MapToSignals<OmitKeyof<TState, keyof BaseQueryNarrowing, \"safely\">>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts:153](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts#L153)\n\nThe result of `injectQuery` when `initialData` isn't set — `data` may be `undefined` while the query is\n`pending`. Same shape as [QueryObserverResult](QueryObserverResult.md) from `@tanstack/query-core`, but value fields (like\n`data`, `error`, `status`) are exposed as a `Signal` — read them with `query.data()`, not `query.data` —\nwhile function fields (like `refetch`) are called directly, unchanged. `isSuccess`/`isError`/`isPending`\nare [BaseQueryNarrowing](../interfaces/BaseQueryNarrowing.md) type-guard methods rather than plain booleans.\n`injectInfiniteQuery` returns [CreateInfiniteQueryResult](CreateInfiniteQueryResult.md) instead.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TState\n\n`TState` = [`QueryObserverResult`](QueryObserverResult.md)\\<`TData`, `TError`\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: CreateBaseQueryResult\ntitle: CreateBaseQueryResult\n---\n\n```ts\ntype CreateBaseQueryResult<TData, TError, TState> = BaseQueryNarrowing<TData, TError> & MapToSignals<OmitKeyof<TState, keyof BaseQueryNarrowing, \"safely\">>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts:153](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts#L153)\n\nThe result of `injectQuery` when `initialData` isn't set — `data` may be `undefined` while the query is\n`pending`. Same shape as [QueryObserverResult](QueryObserverResult.md) from `@tanstack/query-core`, but value fields (like\n`data`, `error`, `status`) are exposed as a `Signal` — read them with `query.data()`, not `query.data` —\nwhile function fields (like `refetch`) are called directly, unchanged. `isSuccess`/`isError`/`isPending`\nare [BaseQueryNarrowing](../interfaces/BaseQueryNarrowing.md) type-guard methods rather than plain booleans.\n`injectInfiniteQuery` returns [CreateInfiniteQueryResult](CreateInfiniteQueryResult.md) instead.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TState\n\n`TState` = [`QueryObserverResult`](QueryObserverResult.md)\\<`TData`, `TError`\\>\n"}
